title IC443 NE diffuse shock -- v_shock=65 km/s, T_obs=10000K, enhanced cosmic-ray test
hden 2.7584
constant temperature, t=10000 K linear
stop column density 21.03
# enhanced cosmic-ray ionization near IC 443 (Indriolo et al. 2010: zeta ~ 2e-15 s^-1,
# about 10 x the default background); check the exact syntax in Hazy 1 before running
cosmic rays background 10 linear
iterate
save results last "v65_T10000_CRtest.rlt"
